{"synopsis":"Ada dua orang yang sangat tergila-gila dengan game Legend of Heroes 2 hingga menghabiskan ribuan jam untuk memainkannya.&#x20;\n\nYang selalu berada di peringkat pertama, Kang Jinho, dan yang selalu berada di peringkat kedua, Hong Yoohee.\n\nSuatu hari, begitu tersadar, mereka telah bereinkarnasi menjadi karakter mereka di dalam game…&#x20;\n\n“Hei… Kau juga?”&#x20;\n\n“Hei… Aku juga!”&#x20;\n\nEnding dari Legend of Heroes 2 adalah akhir dari dunia manusia. Namun, alih-alih hanya satu orang, justru dua orang telah bereinkarnasi secara bersamaan. Apalagi mereka bukan sembarang orang, melainkan player Rank 1 dan Rank 2 di server, Situasinya bisa menjadi berbeda.&#x20;\n\nPerjalanan para gamer veteran untuk mencapai happy ending dimulai sekarang!","alternative_title":"엔딩메이커","author":"Chwiryong","artist":"DOES","chapters":[{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"0a2e8954-c563-4988-954a-abbf8d1a47a9","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"c6f952b5-976b-4876-bfb3-cbd687866b25","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-07-24"},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"1721455e-84bb-4349-bcd3-ff9c2957bb00","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"6dcaaf74-ef55-4951-a631-22ac9bc499aa","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2026-07-04"},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"c988dc00-1418-4b3a-a9df-e704999801ac","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2026-06-27"},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"e2ea7b44-9dbf-4c1e-b540-c1a8c36b7329","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2026-06-19"},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"cda90863-79a1-4a17-a5c9-4b02d68b2586","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"4ff7db6b-5f6a-4cd6-ade8-2180ec301f13","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2026-06-05"},{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"0c437efd-5ccf-4eaa-8b4d-c9b194b9c7df","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2026-05-22"},{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"4c21dee2-9b96-42b8-aa5d-0e201f069a6f","title":"Chapter 